    },
    {
      "id": "solution-003",
      "stage": "optimized",
      "idea": "自底向上的动态规划：从基本情况 memo[0]=0, memo[1]=1 开始，通过循环递推计算 memo[i] = memo[i-1] + memo[i-2]，直到计算出 memo[n]。",
      "timeComplexity": "O(n)",
      "spaceComplexity": "O(n)",
      "limitations": [
